  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1193",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-21T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-21T11:13:14.486Z",
    "meteorologist": "Saroj Pudasainee",
    "analysis_np": "हाल कोशी प्रदशको केहि स्थानमा मनसुनी वायूको प्रभाव रहेको छ । अन्य भू-भागमा पश्चिमी वायू, स्थानीय वायू प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, monsoon winds are influencing some parts of Koshi Province. In the remaining parts of the country, westerly winds and local winds are prevailing.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, मधेश, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराईमा आंशिक बादल तथा लुम्बिनी,र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । कोशी र  गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा तथा बागमती प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा सुदूरपश्चिम र कर्णाली प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । कोशी प्रदेशको तराईका केहि स्थानमा तथा मधेश र बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराईका एक-दुई स्थानमा  मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । कोशी प्रदेशका पहाडी तथा तराई भू-भाग एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको समेत सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, as well as the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces and the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, while the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at some places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi and Gandaki Provinces, at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Bagmati Province, and at one or two places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Sudurpashchim and Karnali Provinces. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and at one or two places in the Terai regions of Madhesh, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. Heavy rainfall is also likely at one or two places in the Hilly and Terai regions of Koshi Province.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । मधेश, बागमती, गण्डकी प्रदेशमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । कोशी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा मधेश प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा तातो लहर तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा पनि  तातो दिन हुने सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country, as well as the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over Madhesh, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. The Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at some places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi Province, at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, and at one or two places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and at one or two places in Madhesh Province. Heatwave conditions are likely at some places in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces, while hot day conditions are also likely at some places in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
}
